{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "Concept Packs (tagged)",
    "purpose": "Semantic roots by pack, each concept tagged with finer-than-pack domains so name classes can favour/lock root selection (e.g. 'flora' minus 'tree').",
    "how_tags_work": "A class rootPolicy include/exclude may name a pack, a tag, or a single concept. Tags let 'flowers and plants but not trees' be expressed as include:['flora'] exclude:['tree'].",
    "additive": "core is always active (additive:false); thematic packs stack on top (additive:true).",
    "notes": [
      "'ash-tree' (core) and 'ashes' (priestly) were split apart — the original data reused 'ash' for both the tree and cremation, a homonym the engine would have minted as one form.",
      "Concepts shared across packs (iron, star, moon, eagle, spear, grace, echo, tide, dawn) are intentional — the engine treats repetition as capped-weight."
    ]
  },
